/// metric called DaysUntilExpiry that tracks the number of days until the
/// certificate expires. The metric is based on the InactiveDate parameter
/// and is published daily in the AWS/Transfer namespace. It can take up to
/// a full day after importing a certificate for Transfer Family to emit the
/// DaysUntilExpiry metric to your account. If you use the Certificate
/// parameter to upload both the certificate and its chain, don't use the
/// CertificateChain parameter. CloudWatch monitoring The DaysUntilExpiry
